  "frame_key": "85163634|1|decision|41",
  "note": "85163634 f41 (Main, mega_starmie seat 1, turn 6). The knockout is already locked and nothing on the board can stop it: our Active Mega Starmie ex carries 3{W}, and Nebula Beam ({C}{C}{C}, 210 dmg) exactly meets Fezandipiti ex's 210 HP for 2 prizes. So the frame only asks what to do with the FREE actions before attacking. The agent played Crushing Hammer; the human ruled Lillie's Determination, because the only Energy on the opponent's board is the single {P} on the Active that is about to be knocked out -- the denial buys nothing, while the hand is thin and Lillie's digs for the Energy the benched Mega Starmie ex needs. Bench: Cinderace (Stage 2, no Energy) and a second Mega Starmie ex played THIS turn (cannot evolve, no Energy).",
